Add :func:`icalendar.freebusy.synthesize_freebusy`, which combines the ``FREEBUSY`` periods of several ``VFREEBUSY`` components into one non-overlapping timeline for a UTC query window. Each segment of the resulting :class:`~icalendar.freebusy.FreeBusyReport` carries the effective ``FBTYPE``, chosen with a caller-supplied priority, and the set of sources that contribute to it, so scheduling services can explain why a time is busy. Time that no input covers is reported as unknown rather than free, and the report can be rendered back into a standard-conformant ``VFREEBUSY`` component.
